# Print-in-place fit proof: the coin + axles must be a free captive body,
# clearing the ring on every surface (rim moat + both teardrop sockets) at rest
# AND across the whole flip.
# `fitcheck`       rotor ∩ ring at REST — must be EMPTY.
# `fitcheck_neg`   sockets driven into the axles — MUST overlap (control).
# `fitcheck_flip`  rotor swept through the flip ∩ ring — must be EMPTY (the
#                  coin clears the bore and the loop tab at every tilt; the
#                  check the rest-pose fitcheck and the bore assert can't make).
# `fitcheck_flip_neg` an oversized coin flipped into the bore — MUST overlap.
fitcheck           empty
fitcheck_neg       interferes
fitcheck_flip      empty
fitcheck_flip_neg  interferes
